This distribution includes protocol definitions derived from RustDesk and
binary/source components from FreeRDP, OpenSSL, FFmpeg, libssh2, Mbed TLS,
Opus, the platform zlib library, Huawei/OpenHarmony SDK packages, and Rust crates including the Apache-2.0 Alacritty terminal core. No project license
statement removes or replaces their upstream notices.

Debug builds additionally include libfido2 1.17.0 and libcbor 0.14.0 for the
explicitly authorized USB capability probe. Their source archives, local
custom-I/O patch, per-ABI manifests and full upstream notices are identified
in docs/compliance/FIDO2_OHOS_PROVENANCE.md and libs/fido2-ohos/. They are
excluded from Release native linking.

